# ─── Convex (auto-populated by `npx convex dev`) ─────────────────────────────

# Your Convex project's deployment slug
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=dev:your-deployment-slug

# The HTTPS URL for your Convex deployment (used by the Vite frontend)
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment-slug.convex.cloud

# ─── Convex environment variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are set in the Convex dashboard (not in this file):
#   npx convex dashboard  →  Settings → Environment Variables
#
#   ADMIN_PIN      – PIN required to access the admin dashboard (required)
#   NTFY_TOPIC     – ntfy.sh topic name for push notifications (optional)
#   APP_URL        – Public URL of your deployed app, e.g. https://rushes.example.com
#                    Used to add an "Open Admin Portal" action button in ntfy
#                    notifications (optional, but recommended when NTFY_TOPIC is set)
